# Blog Platform with Comments

A full-stack blog platform developed as part of my **Thiranex Full Stack Development Internship – Task 4**. The application allows users to create and manage blog posts and interact with other users through comments.

## Features

- User registration and login
- User authentication and authorization
- Create, edit, and delete blog posts
- Add comments to blog posts
- View posts created by users
- RESTful API integration
- Database integration
- Responsive user interface

## Technologies Used

**Frontend**
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

**Backend**
- Node.js
- Express.js

**Database**
- MongoDB
- Mongoose

**Authentication**
- JSON Web Token (JWT)
- bcrypt.js

